==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|knockwurst}}

===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|de|en}} noun {{m|de|Knackwurst}}, itself from {{etyl|de|en}} {{m|de|knacken||to crack, crackle}} + {{m|de|Wurst||sausage}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A highly seasoned [[scalded]] [[sausage]] made from beef, pork, and fatty tissue similar to a [[frankfurter]], but shorter and thicker.

